-    API documentation for Password.
+    Internal CM password setup/reset. CM validates user entitlement and the approved one-time Code.
+    Internal APIC authenticates and authorizes the CM subscription before routing to DSP.
+    DSP password services do not revalidate APIC client credentials or require a duplicate credential configuration.
+    A creates a password; M replaces an existing active password without an old password.
+    Password hash format is Base64(raw SHA-256(UTF-8(password))), stored without rehashing.
