-    | **X-IBM-Client-Id** | `string` | **M** | APIC client ID. Corporate retrieves the info when onboarding. | `client-id-12345` |
-    | **X-IBM-Client-Secret** | `string` | **M** | APIC secret. Corporate retrieves the info when onboarding. | `client-secret-abcde` |
+    | **Channel** | `string` | **M** | Distinguish channel (HTH, BCO, BCM). CM sends 'BCO'. | `BCO` |
+    | **X-IBM-Client-Id** | `string` | **M** | Internal APIC caller ID, validated by APIC. Reuses the existing BM DSP subscription. | `client-id-12345` |
+    | **X-IBM-Client-Secret** | `string` | **M** | Internal APIC caller secret, validated by APIC. Not a DSP password-service configuration. | `client-secret-abcde` |
 
